$\begin{array}{lll}
\mathrmX^{+2}& \mathrmY^{+5} & \mathrmZ^{-2}
\end{array} Overall charge on compound formed by elements X. Y$ and $\mathrm{Z}$ should be zero. $\begin{aligned}& \mathrm{X}_{3}\left(\mathrm{YZ}_{4}\right)_2 \Rightarrow 3 \times2+2 \times5+8 \times(-2)=0 \\
& \mathrm{X}\left(\mathrm{Y}_{4} \mathrm{Z}\right) \Rightarrow1 \times2+4 \times5+1 \times(-2) ≠ 0 \\
& \mathrm{X}_{3}\left(\mathrm{YZ}_{2}\right)_2 \Rightarrow 3 \times2+2 \times5+4 \times(-2) ≠ 0 \\
& \mathrm{XYZ}_{2} \Rightarrow 1 \times2+1 \times5+2 \times(-2) ≠ 0
\end{aligned}
$
